<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 587.76, up 0.57.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 274 to 258.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.02.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 22,191,260, compared with 23,724,290 Wednesday.</p>
<p>	     (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
